description = "Ponygirls, Whorses, She-Beasts, or Ponycunts. There are many names for them, but in essence, they are tall-folk - mostly elves and humans - who are stripped naked and made to serve as mounts for their goblin masters.
In the past, ponygirls were literal slaves, kidnapped during raids or bought and sold at markets.
Today, things are different. Goblins are allies of the Empire, and being bred by a strong, potent goblin is considered a reliable way to become pregnant. Besides, almost everyone knows that goblin seed is extraordinarily healthy. It can supposedly cure almost anything, and some even claim it reverses aging.
On top of that, many tall-folk women seem to possess an inexplicable fascination with serving as ponycunts - though most would never openly admit it.

— Excerpt from “Ponygirls of the Borderlands: An Essay on Goblins and Their Mounts,” by Scholar Lula of Trisa Academy"
